(7156881, 1097519, 114225, '<td valign="top">What great light and setting.<br/> <br/>But I''m curious, why hide the bride behind a big weed? And why is the sky in the upper right so weird?</td>', 'What great light and setting. But I''m curious, why hide the bride behind a big weed? And why is the sky in the upper right so weird?', '2014-01-13 13:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
