(7157798, 1097596, 121949, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out how to add comments to my image now that I am not a member. So I will here. I agree with Neat. The eyes are overdone. They didn''t start that way but I shot this last tuesday night and only had a couple hours to edit. When I reduced the size of the image it just wasn''t right but I didn''t have time to redo it. I wanted to eyes to be the focus but they are too sharp. Other than that I am pretty happy with the image.</td>', 'I can''t figure out how to add comments to my image now that I am not a member. So I will here. I agree with Neat. The eyes are overdone. They didn''t start that way but I shot this last tuesday night and only had a couple hours to edit. When I reduced the size of the image it just wasn''t right but I didn''t have time to redo it. I wanted to eyes to be the focus but they are too sharp. Other than that I am pretty happy with the image.', '2014-01-15 08:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
