(7157849, 1097021, 174095, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cory:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh damn.  Pano?  Beautiful shot - Please stay and give this another go - a top ten is great, even if it does get dq''d! :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/>How do I see if I''ve been disqualified? This is my first time on DPChallenge, I wasn''t notified of the image being disqualified. Although it is pano, I took multiple images and stitched them together. Thank you for the feed back and in the future I will pay closer attention to the guidelines. Thanks again!</td>', 'Originally posted by Cory: Oh damn.  Pano?  Beautiful shot - Please stay and give this another go - a top ten is great, even if it does get dq''d! :D  How do I see if I''ve been disqualified? This is my first time on DPChallenge, I wasn''t notified of the image being disqualified. Although it is pano, I took multiple images and stitched them together. Thank you for the feed back and in the future I will pay closer attention to the guidelines. Thanks again!', '2014-01-15 09:38:03.000000', NULL, 0),
