(7157884, 1097021, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!! Love that tiny moon :)<br/> <br/>And yes, you will likely be receiving a DQ notice in the next few days - it takes a while, and is not automatic. You can use multiple images for an HDR, but not for stitching together to create a pano. Lots of rules to learn!!!  A whole bunch of us have been DQd at some point. You''ve made an auspicious start, so please DO stick around!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!! Love that tiny moon :) And yes, you will likely be receiving a DQ notice in the next few days - it takes a while, and is not automatic. You can use multiple images for an HDR, but not for stitching together to create a pano. Lots of rules to learn!!!  A whole bunch of us have been DQd at some point. You''ve made an auspicious start, so please DO stick around!!', '2014-01-15 11:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7157887, 1097451, 96751, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the tt! Although I do like the harsh lighting, it makes it look like a composite - with the model shot in studio and dropped into that incredible background. The result is a very cool portrait (great model!!!).</td>', 'Congrats on the tt! Although I do like the harsh lighting, it makes it look like a composite - with the model shot in studio and dropped into that incredible background. The result is a very cool portrait (great model!!!).', '2014-01-15 11:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
