(7157913, 1097021, 174095, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful!!! Love that tiny moon :)<br/> <br/>And yes, you will likely be receiving a DQ notice in the next few days - it takes a while, and is not automatic. You can use multiple images for an HDR, but not for stitching together to create a pano. Lots of rules to learn!!!  A whole bunch of us have been DQd at some point. You''ve made an auspicious start, so please DO stick around!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the kind words and the advice! I will be entering again thanks for the encouragement.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Beautiful!!! Love that tiny moon :) And yes, you will likely be receiving a DQ notice in the next few days - it takes a while, and is not automatic. You can use multiple images for an HDR, but not for stitching together to create a pano. Lots of rules to learn!!!  A whole bunch of us have been DQd at some point. You''ve made an auspicious start, so please DO stick around!!   Thanks for the kind words and the advice! I will be entering again thanks for the encouragement.', '2014-01-15 12:53:39.000000', NULL, 0),
