(7158010, 1097559, 19825, '<td valign="top">As usual, an excellent image with masterful processing. I love the warm colors in the sky contrasted by the coolness of the boat and ice. Great job,.</td>', 'As usual, an excellent image with masterful processing. I love the warm colors in the sky contrasted by the coolness of the boat and ice. Great job,.', '2014-01-15 17:32:32.000000', NULL, 0),
